{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/stream.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731177Z","id":"d98ab4255e278e6fbb4b1da311ff2e95afa031ccc93e29b5fc93b81214058577","body":{"detail":"A tab hidden for HIDDEN_MS (30 s) releases its topics and fetches its state again when it shows; the shared connection has no per-tab resume point.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":319},"end":{"line":338},"content_hash":"50c522e84cb5cdc1713ecbc3f861987420515d73d6fa24c51e8100ef15d8744e"},"suggested_fix":"Per-topic rings in the worker would let a briefly hidden tab replay instead.","summary":"A hidden tab's catch-up is a refetch","tags":["perf","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/stream.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:32:59.731211Z","id":"55c90b79a7e526231bc7e5ebdf5e0ac62f9a4eec00f9122f4bbf705541e6f834","body":{"detail":"A tab counts its hub gone after DEAD_MS (35 s) without a ping, or at once where the browser fires close on the worker's port. A worker that lives but hangs is not restarted, since a new SharedWorker of the same name reaches the same instance. Leader tabs are not pinged at all: a hidden leader's timers are throttled and its followers would replace it needlessly; a leader hidden for 30 s leaves, so a frozen tab does not hold the connection for long.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":440},"end":{"line":443},"content_hash":"3643dd1ee71089c5de9eefb664e36a0c9b7381f7a039d5bd1209b1a37d43fcdf"},"summary":"The shared worker is checked only by its pings; a hung worker is not restarted","tags":["session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/stream-hub.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:26:52.183528Z","id":"af99e0847d6ce2acbeb8dc02c4fb0ecccc1422f8ce16b5f5205a33dc2489b39e","body":{"detail":"drop() aborts the current connection. When that connection is a GET /api/stream whose response has not reached the page yet, Chrome keeps the socket to drain the response for reuse (about 5 s; the SSE body never ends) and only then closes it, so the daemon counts the stream attached meanwhile (`open` and `levels` in GET /api/_test/stream/open). web/e2e/streams.spec.ts saw two admin streams for about 5 s this way when one rename caused several reopens. The hub now reopens once per caller change, so this remains only when a reopen lands while a connect is in flight. The daemon detaches a closed client within a millisecond; the delay is the browser's.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":461},"end":{"line":467},"content_hash":"50f43433859ae4b4960306f84d9917ae901ccd99c2692329e7e275099aa83ca7"},"summary":"A stream request aborted before it answers stays open on the daemon for up to 5 s","tags":["risk","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/shell/src/owner.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:26:52.183696Z","id":"39039ebd109e36a9ab6fa0a5b16c7fbc7afba8fa60ff45ae6e1bb7110fbd04b0","body":{"detail":"After getToken() fails, ownerBrowser() retries with its own fetch of /api/token. When that succeeds the browser holds the events cookie, but api.ts's tokenPromise stays unset and its onToken listeners do not run, so the next getToken() fetches the token again, and the page's stream is reopened as the owner's only when the hub's next subscription on the old stream is refused (stream-hub.ts, unknown_stream) or a later getToken() succeeds. web/e2e/streams.spec.ts (the late-token test) shows the stream still reopening once.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":16},"end":{"line":19},"content_hash":"59b34f86a2eaf058ac291d8fa806118099047e4ca5716284f58f1e542cfb2ea4"},"suggested_fix":"Retry through getToken() (after its memo is dropped) so a success sets the memo and runs the onToken listeners.","summary":"ownerBrowser's own token retry leaves getToken's memo failed","tags":["review","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
